AgriDabaw-3D: A Simulation Game with AI-Advisor for Localized Farming Techniques.
Undergraduate capstone project, Assumption College of Davao.
Adviser: Mr. Dennis B. Gajo, MIT.

This repository holds the game's backend server. Its source is public so that
the capstone panel, the college and other readers can review it.

